      "writtenOn": "2022-09-21T12:40:42Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Because there are lots of module types which do not provide a min_sdk_version property (e.g. compat_config) that are already exported to S+. They need to have a min_sdk_version \u003c\u003d S but there is no way to specify that in the bp file.\n\nSo, if this defaulted to current for module types that did not support a min_sdk_version then those module types would not be included in the snapshots for anything other than the latest release.",
